[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0048","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1534","title":"Joomla Shoutbox Pro 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Shoutbox Pro（com_shoutbox）组件 1.3 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 controller 参数传递包含 `..`（点点）的恶意路径，绕过访问控制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于组件未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分的过滤与验证，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，结合公开的 PoC 可实现敏感信息泄露。影响范围包括使用该组件的所有 Joomla! 站点，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1534"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-26T18:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:34Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载 Joomla! Shoutbox Pro 组件，或升级到已修复路径遍历漏洞的最新版本。如无官方补丁，可直接删除或禁用 com_shoutbox 组件目录，并在 .htaccess 中添加规则过滤 `controller` 参数中的 `..` 路径遍历字符作为临时缓解。对于不再维护的第三方扩展，迁移到替代组件是最彻底的修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/63562","http://secunia.com/advisories/39352","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12067","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39213","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57534","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12067","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1534.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1534.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1534.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-1534.js","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-1534.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-1534-1720.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-1534_40.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-1534_4.yaml",