updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 redSHOP 组件至 1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 view 参数目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，则应在 Joomla! 后台卸载 com_redshop 组件，或在 .htaccess 中对 view 参数添加正则过滤规则阻止 `../` 序列。亦可限制 `index.php?option=com_redshop` 的访问来源 IP 作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlaredshop-lfi.txt","http://redcomponent.com/redshop/redshop-changelog","http://secunia.com/advisories/39343","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12054","http://www.osvdb.org/63535","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39206","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57512","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12054","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1531.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1531.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1531.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-1531.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-1531-1706.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2010-1531-1704.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-1531_27.yaml","https://github.com/cyb3r-w0lf/nuclei-template-collection/blob/7025ebe04ab60b84aee0af1ecf4f90601332e8e7/nuclei-templates/CVE-2010/cve-2010-1531.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/cve-2010-1531-1703.yaml","https://github.com/sassman/cve-lang-ollama-classifier/blob/d91c5ebdc34e6f73284efab9d651c6adc02808d9/cvelistV5-main/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1531.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/