-1494.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/41001-to-42000-templates/z-11753.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2010/CVE-2010-1494.md","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1494.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0042","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1491","title":"Joomla! MMS Blog 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 MMS Blog 组件 2.3.0 中存在目录遍历漏洞，该漏洞源于程序对 controller 参数过滤不严，远程攻击者可通过在参数中注入 ../ 序列构造恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意敏感文件，如配置文件等。影响运行 Joomla! 且安装 MMS Blog 2.3.0 组件的网站，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1491"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-23T14:30:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:29Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 MMS Blog (com_mmsblog) 2.3.0 组件，该组件已长期无人维护且无官方补丁。同时检查服务器上是否仍存在 controller 参数传递，在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层添加规则拦截 `..` 目录遍历攻击载荷。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的 Joomla! 博客扩展。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlammsblog-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39533","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12318","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39607","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12318","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1491.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1491.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1491.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-1491.js","https://github.com