任意文件读取，可能进一步导致敏感信息泄露或其他未明影响。该漏洞利用难度低，无需身份认证即可触发，影响运行该组件的 Joomla! 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1476"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-19T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 AlphaUserPoints 组件至官方最新版本（高于 1.5.5），或在 Joomla! 后台卸载 com_alphauserpoints 组件以彻底消除风险。如因业务必须保留，可修改 controller.php 中对 view 参数的取值逻辑，过滤 `../` 等目录穿越字符，并限制 view 参数仅允许字母数字和白名单路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlaalphauserpoints-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39250","http://www.alphaplug.com/","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12150","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39393","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12150","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1476.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1476.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1476.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-1476.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-1476-1679.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-1476-1680.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-1476_36.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/09/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/0xlwoe21k/wkg/blob/ebcdefd3af515128431a6aaa19182691adaf891b/backend/assets/nuclei-templates/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1476.yaml","https://github.com/kozlm/Scanropod/blob/e836c2bacd6b42482f56e0ef0bd2f29467a45958/config/cwe-lists/nuclei-csv.csv","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2010-1476.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0039","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1475","title":"Joomla Preventive And Reservation 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Preventive & Reservation (com_preventive) 组件 1.0.5 版本存在目录遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过向 index.php 文件的 controller 参数传递 ../ 等目录跳转序列，绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞无需身份认证，远程即可利用，可能导致数据库配置、系统密码等敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。受影响版本为 Joomla! 配合此组件的部署环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1475"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-19T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:27Z","remediation":"立即卸载或停用 com_preventive 组件 1.0.5 版本，该组件已停止维护且无官方补丁。如业务必需，可在 Joomla! 入口文件或 .htaccess 中对 controller 参数添加正则过滤，阻止包含 `../` 等目录遍历字符的请求。建议迁移至替代的预约管理扩展。同时可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层配置规则拦截路径遍历攻击载荷作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlapr-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39285","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12147","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39387","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57652","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12147","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1475.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1475.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1475.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-1475.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-1475-1678.ya