itle":"Joomla! Advertising 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Advertising 组件（版本 0.25）存在目录遍历漏洞，该漏洞源于对 controller 参数缺乏充分的过滤检查。远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 传递包含 `../` 等目录跳转序列的特制请求，实现任意文件读取，可能导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度较低，无需身份认证即可利用。CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1473"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-19T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:27Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Joomla! 的 Advertising (com_advertising) 组件 0.25 版本，该组件已不再维护且存在目录遍历漏洞。作为替代方案，使用其他受支持的广告管理扩展。如无法卸载，在服务器层面限制 index.php 的 controller 参数仅允许白名单值，并禁用 .. 路径遍历。更新 Joomla! 核心至最新版本以启用内置安全机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlaeasyadbanner-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39410","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12171","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12171","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1473.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1473.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1473.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ada0fed8a5975a1e69890298da5128a1d96babb/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1473.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2010-1473-1666.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1473.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-1473_33.yaml","https://github.com/baric6/ThreatHunting/blob/fa3a6cd3a5755f5dc3018997186ddb7b76717945/cvePoC_2010.json","https://github.com/TonyStark1109/JARVIS-MARK-5/blob/756e6a7362ebce8a56e07f16413733ad23d90c7a/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1473.yaml","https://github.com/